  "body": "Live In, Enjoy or Make It Your Own!\r\n\r\nSet on a beautiful 812sqm freehold section, this solid block and Hardiplank home offers the best of both worlds - a comfortable place to call home as it is today, with exciting opportunities to add your own touch over time. Whether you're looking to move straight in, renovate, enhance or simply enjoy the space and coastal lifestyle, there's plenty here to get excited about!\r\n\r\nThe home offers approximately 113sqm of floor area, featuring two bedrooms, a bathroom, a comfortable living area and a substantial downstairs rumpus room that flows out onto a large covered deck. A fantastic space for entertaining, relaxing or enjoying the peaceful green surroundings.\r\n\r\nAnd for those with an eye for potential, imagine adding a beautiful wraparound deck, perfectly positioned to make the most of the lovely green outlook. Enjoy what is already here or let your imagination take it to the next level!\r\n\r\nBut wait, there's more!\r\n\r\nThe extra-large detached garage at the rear, complete with an additional rumpus area, is a real bonus! Whether you're after generous vehicle storage, room for your tools, a workshop, hobby space or a home gym, there's plenty of flexibility to suit your needs.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the section itself! With 812sqm of land to enjoy, there's room for keen gardeners, children and pets, outdoor entertaining or perhaps even that dream swimming pool, subject to the necessary approvals. Add ample off-street parking, and you've got space for all the extras!\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Coastal living at its best!\r\nPositioned towards the end of the beautiful Whangaparaoa Peninsula, you'll enjoy a peaceful setting surrounded by some of the area's best natural attractions. Explore nearby Everard Reserve, beautiful Okoromai Bay, the spectacular Shakespear Regional Park and a wonderful selection of beaches and coastal walks. For golf lovers, Whangaparaoa Golf Club is just around the corner.\r\n\r\nWith Penlink well underway, future connections to the North Shore and Auckland City are set to become even more convenient, making it easier to enjoy everything the peninsula and wider Auckland have to offer.\r\n\r\nLive in it. Love it. Enhance it. The choice is yours!\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a place to settle into and enjoy, a property with room for your hobbies and lifestyle, or an opportunity to add value over time, this Army Bay gem has so much to offer.\r\n\r\nThe space is here. The lifestyle is here. And the potential is yours to explore!\r\n\r\nCome and discover the possibilities for yourself.\r\n\r\nDownload documents here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/755H",
